Package: effectagram
Title: Cross-Generalized Effect Geometry
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Bradley", "Buchsbaum", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "bradley.buchsbaum@gmail.com")
Description: Compiles fixed experimental-neural relations, additive spatial
    frames, and partition pairings into cross-generalized geometry. The initial
    implementation establishes the semantic contracts for additive-frame
    collapse, pairing marginals, and deterministic sequential execution.
